    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Welcome to AI Chat Lab!\r\n\r\nYou may have heard of terms such as artificial intelligence, machine learning, data science, deep learning, or natural language processing - what do all these phrases mean? \r\n\r\nThis AI chat will quiz you on key terms related to AI and give you feedback on your answers. It's okay if you don't get them all right! The goal of this level is to learn something new.\r\n\r\nStart the chat by saying:\r\n> I'm ready to begin!\r\n\r\n*Spend as much time interacting with the chatbot as you find helpful. Key terms are summarized on the next level.*",
    "aichat_settings": {
      "initialCustomizations": {
        "selectedModelId": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "temperature": 0.5,
        "systemPrompt": "I'm ready to begin!",
        "retrievalContexts": [
          "Artificial Intelligence (AI): AI is the branch of computer science that aims to develop systems capable of performing tasks that would normally require human intelligence, including decision-making, visual perception, and speech recognition.",
          "Machine Learning: ML is a subset of AI that involves training algorithms to learn patterns and make decisions with minimal human intervention, based on data.",
          "Natural Language Processing: NLP is a field at the intersection of computer science, artificial intelligence, and linguistics, focused on enabling computers to understand, interpret, and generate human language.\n",
          "Deep Learning: Deep learning is a subset of machine learning that uses neural networks with many layers (deep neural networks) to analyze large volumes of data, enabling the model to learn complex patterns.\n",
          "Large Language Models: These are advanced deep learning models trained on extensive corpora of text data, capable of understanding and generating human-like text by predicting subsequent parts of text based on the input they receive.\n",
          "ChatGPT: ChatGPT is a prominent example of a large language model, developed by OpenAI, designed specifically for generating human-like responses in a conversational context by processing and producing text based on its training on a diverse dataset.\n",
          "Data Science: an interdisciplinary field that uses scientific methods, processes, algorithms, and systems to extract knowledge and insights from structured and unstructured data.\n"
        ],
